                                                "sense_id": "d2c1fd03-b19a-39ca-9676-f6190c79c9c8",
                                                "text": "2006 March 13, Richard Lugar, speech to the Brookings Institution,\n[…] energy is the albatross of U.S. national security."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1f16d37-2a3a-4df0-8df8-5ba761cda6bc",
